              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chris"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This soup is delicious. I added an extra cup of milk to add more liquid. Also, I followed the comments advice to add pasta. Absolutely great mix but don’t add too much pasta like I did. I ended up taking some of it out since pasta absorbs liquid. Go figure.",
