              "name": "kirby8988"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Add 2 heaping Tablespoons of the bottled minced garlic, use Shrimp Stock and add 1/4t Crushed Red Pepper and you will have a soup that is amazing ! (rather than just average as it's written)",
