            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "veggiemonster"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this completely vegetarian, using veggie rather than chicken broth and omitting the shrimp. Also, I added minced garlic and used white onion instead of green, as well as a couple Russet potatoes chopped up relatively small. The nutmeg really brings this recipe together. For extra-awesome taste, try adding a slice of White American cheese during the simmer. Doing so turned this into my favorite soup ever, and really brought it to a new level of deliciousness!",
            "datePublished": "2010-05-21T17:41:46.423Z"
